[{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「啊……啊……芳乃」","art":{"background":"a2206","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「又射了好多啊、啊、啊……嗯、嗯嗯」","art":{"background":"a2207","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"这次只有我一个人去了。","art":{"background":"a2207","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"我喜欢看芳乃高潮的样子，射精也很舒服。","art":{"background":"a2207","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"但……还是比不过一起迎来高潮的充实感……","art":{"background":"a2207","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「………」","art":{"background":"a2207","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然两次射精让我浑身乏力，但我还是用腰压在芳乃的臀部上以圆形的轨迹进行活动。","art":{"background":"a2207","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「呀嗯！？呃，啊，嗯嗯……将、将臣？」","art":{"background":"a2207","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「可以再来一次吗？这次我想和你一起去。我想和你一起高潮」","art":{"background":"a2207","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「嗯……我也想一起高潮……」","art":{"background":"a2207","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「嗯，和我一起高潮吧」","art":{"background":"a2207","sprites":[]},"chapter":"7-3"}]